      "template": "<div lang=\"en\" style=\"width:100%; min-height:100vh; background:#0a0a09; font-family:'Cormorant Garamond', serif; box-sizing:border-box;\">\n\n  \n\n  \n\n  <main data-pagefind-meta=\"url:/en/collection/colombia/banco-de-colombia-1-peso-oro-1919/\" id=\"main-content\" tabindex=\"-1\" data-screen-label=\"El Banco de Colombia — Mortgage Certificate 1 Peso Oro (1919)\" style=\"max-width:1180px; margin:0 auto; padding:56px 24px 80px; outline:none;\">\n\n    <a href=\"/en/collection/colombia/free-banking/\" style=\"display:inline-block; color:#e7ddc4; text-decoration:none; font-size:15px; letter-spacing:0.08em; margin-bottom:24px;\">&larr; Free Banking catalog</a>\n\n    <div style=\"background:#d8d2cd; border:1px solid rgba(10,10,9,0.08); border-radius:3px; padding:clamp(28px,4vw,64px); box-shadow:0 30px 70px rgba(0,0,0,0.45);\">\n\n      <div style=\"display:flex; flex-direction:column; align-items:center;\">\n\n        <div style=\"text-align:center; max-width:720px; margin:0 auto 40px;\">\n          <span style=\"display:block; font-size:14px; letter-spacing:0.22em; text-transform:uppercase; color:#5c4e33; margin-bottom:14px;\">Historical Securities and Certificates &middot; Bogotá &middot; 1919</span>\n          <h1 style=\"font-family:'Montenegrin Gothic One', serif; font-weight:400; font-size:clamp(28px,4vw,44px); line-height:1.08; letter-spacing:0.01em; color:#1c1a15; margin:0 0 12px;\">El Banco de Colombia</h1>\n          <p style=\"font-size:clamp(19px,2vw,23px); font-style:italic; color:#4a4331; margin:0;\">Mortgage Certificate &middot; Series Z &middot; One Peso in Legal Gold</p>\n        </div>\n\n        <div style=\"width:100%; max-width:560px; display:flex; flex-direction:column; gap:14px; margin:0 auto 56px;\">\n          <button\n            data-zoom-trigger=\"colombia-banco-de-colombia-1-peso-oro-1919\"\n            aria-label=\"Enlarge imagen de la cédula\"\n            style=\"all:unset; display:block; width:100%; position:relative; cursor:zoom-in;\"\n          >\n            <picture>\n              <source srcset=\"/uploads/colombia-banco-de-colombia-1-peso-oro-1919.webp\" type=\"image/webp\" />\n              <img\n                src=\"/uploads/colombia-banco-de-colombia-1-peso-oro-1919.jpg\"\n                alt=\"Mortgage certificate of El Banco de Colombia, obverse above with a red Andean-condor vignette, reverse below with a blue guilloche frame and contractual text\"\n                width=\"564\"\n                height=\"697\"\n                loading=\"eager\"\n                decoding=\"async\"\n                style=\"display:block; width:100%; height:auto;\"\n              />\n            </picture>\n            <span style=\"position:absolute; bottom:22px; right:22px; display:flex; align-items:center; gap:8px; background:rgba(10,10,9,0.82); color:#d8d2cd; font-size:13px; letter-spacing:0.08em; padding:8px 14px; border-radius:999px;\">\n              <span style=\"width:6px; height:6px; background:#d8d2cd; transform:rotate(45deg);\"></span>Enlarge</span>\n          </button>\n          <span style=\"font-size:13px; letter-spacing:0.08em; color:#5c4e33; text-align:center; font-style:italic;\">Obverse (top) and reverse (bottom) — Notofilia.com Collection</span>\n<div style=\"display:flex; flex-direction:column;\">\n            <div style=\"display:grid; grid-template-columns:200px 1fr; gap:6px 20px; padding:14px 0; border-top:1px solid rgba(10,10,9,0.12);\">\n              <span style=\"font-size:14px; letter-spacing:0.1em; text-transform:uppercase; color:#5c4e33;\">Country</span>\n              <span style=\"font-size:19px; color:#221f19;\">Colombia (Bogotá)</span>\n            </div>\n            <div style=\"display:grid; grid-template-columns:200px 1fr; gap:6px 20px; padding:14px 0; border-top:1px solid rgba(10,10,9,0.12);\">\n              <span style=\"font-size:14px; letter-spacing:0.1em; text-transform:uppercase; color:#5c4e33;\">Issuing Entity</span>\n              <span style=\"font-size:19px; color:#221f19;\">The Bank of Colombia, established in Bogotá</span>\n            </div>\n            <div style=\"display:grid; grid-template-columns:200px 1fr; gap:6px 20px; padding:14px 0; border-top:1px solid rgba(10,10,9,0.12);\">\n              <span style=\"font-size:14px; letter-spacing:0.1em; text-transform:uppercase; color:#5c4e33;\">Document Type</span>\n              <span style=\"font-size:19px; color:#221f19;\">Mortgage certificate &mdash; security title with real estate backing and authorized fiduciary circulation</span>\n            </div>\n            <div style=\"display:grid; grid-template-columns:200px 1fr; gap:6px 20px; padding:14px 0; border-top:1px solid rgba(10,10,9,0.12);\">\n              <span style=\"font-size:14px; letter-spacing:0.1em; text-transform:uppercase; color:#5c4e33;\">Denomination</span>\n              <span style=\"font-size:19px; color:#221f19;\">One Peso in Legal Gold, equivalent to four shillings (&pound; 0.4.0) in British currency</span>\n            </div>\n            <div style=\"display:grid; grid-template-columns:200px 1fr; gap:6px 20px; padding:14px 0; border-top:1px solid rgba(10,10,9,0.12);\">\n              <span style=\"font-size:14px; letter-spacing:0.1em; text-transform:uppercase; color:#5c4e33;\">Material</span>\n              <span style=\"font-size:19px; color:#221f19;\">Vintage security paper, with light fibers</span>\n            </div>\n            <div style=\"display:grid; grid-template-columns:200px 1fr; gap:6px 20px; padding:14px 0; border-top:1px solid rgba(10,10,9,0.12);\">\n              <span style=\"font-size:14px; letter-spacing:0.1em; text-transform:uppercase; color:#5c4e33;\">Printer</span>\n              <span style=\"font-size:19px; color:#221f19;\">Litografía Nacional / Private commercial printing press, Bogotá</span>\n            </div>\n            <div style=\"display:grid; grid-template-columns:200px 1fr; gap:6px 20px; padding:14px 0; border-top:1px solid rgba(10,10,9,0.12);\">\n              <span style=\"font-size:14px; letter-spacing:0.1em; text-transform:uppercase; color:#5c4e33;\">Series / Number</span>\n              <span style=\"font-size:19px; color:#221f19;\">Series Z, No.&deg; 103.697</span>\n            </div>\n            <div style=\"display:grid; grid-template-columns:200px 1fr; gap:6px 20px; padding:14px 0; border-top:1px solid rgba(10,10,9,0.12);\">\n              <span style=\"font-size:14px; letter-spacing:0.1em; text-transform:uppercase; color:#5c4e33;\">Place and Date of Issue</span>\n              <span style=\"font-size:19px; color:#221f19;\">Bogotá, 1.&deg; January 1919</span>\n            </div>\n            <div style=\"display:grid; grid-template-columns:200px 1fr; gap:6px 20px; padding:14px 0; border-top:1px solid rgba(10,10,9,0.12);\">\n              <span style=\"font-size:14px; letter-spacing:0.1em; text-transform:uppercase; color:#5c4e33;\">Signatories</span>\n              <span style=\"font-size:19px; color:#221f19;\">Ernesto Michelsen &middot; Eduardo Collins &middot; Liborio Maldonado C.</span>\n            </div>\n            <div style=\"display:grid; grid-template-columns:200px 1fr; gap:6px 20px; padding:14px 0; border-top:1px solid rgba(10,10,9,0.12);\">\n              <span style=\"font-size:14px; letter-spacing:0.1em; text-transform:uppercase; color:#5c4e33;\">Legal Framework</span>\n              <span style=\"font-size:19px; color:#221f19;\">Law 24 of 1905 and contract between the National Government and the Bank of Colombia of February 6, 1912</span>\n            </div>\n            <div style=\"display:grid; grid-template-columns:200px 1fr; gap:6px 20px; padding:14px 0; border-top:1px solid rgba(10,10,9,0.12);\">\n              <span style=\"font-size:14px; letter-spacing:0.1em; text-transform:uppercase; color:#5c4e33;\">Dimensions</span>\n              <span style=\"font-size:19px; color:#221f19;\">Intermediate format of bank certificate, approx. 145 &times; 80mm</span>\n            </div>\n            <div style=\"display:grid; grid-template-columns:200px 1fr; gap:6px 20px; padding:14px 0; border-top:1px solid rgba(10,10,9,0.12); border-bottom:1px solid rgba(10,10,9,0.12);\">\n              <span style=\"font-size:14px; letter-spacing:0.1em; text-transform:uppercase; color:#5c4e33;\">Catalog Reference</span>\n              <span style=\"font-size:19px; color:#221f19;\">Listed in sections of private banking and emergency financial securities of Colombia</span>\n            </div>\n          </div>\n\n        </div>\n\n        <div style=\"width:100%; max-width:760px;\">\n          \n\n          <div style=\"margin-top:44px;\">\n            <h2 style=\"font-size:15px; letter-spacing:0.2em; text-transform:uppercase; color:#5c4e33; font-weight:600; margin:0 0 14px; font-style:normal;\">Historical and Issue Context</h2>\n            <p style=\"font-size:19px; line-height:1.65; color:#332e22; margin:0 0 12px;\"><strong style=\"color:#1c1a15;\">A certificate, not a banknote:</strong>unlike circulating banknotes from the free-banking era, this piece is a mortgage certificate &mdash;a debt security backed by real-estate mortgages and authorized to circulate with fiduciary force under a specific legal framework: Law 24 of 1905 and the contract signed by the National Government and El Banco de Colombia on February 6, 1912.</p>\n            <p style=\"font-size:19px; line-height:1.65; color:#332e22; margin:0 0 12px;\"><strong style=\"color:#1c1a15;\">The equivalent in pounds sterling:</strong>The text expresses the value of the certificate both in gold pesos and in its exact equivalent in English shillings (&pound;0.4.0) &mdash; a stabilization mechanism that sought to anchor the confidence of the instrument to a recognized international monetary standard, in the financial context after the First World War.</p>\n            <p style=\"font-size:19px; line-height:1.65; color:#332e22; margin:0;\"><strong style=\"color:#1c1a15;\">A publicly reproduced contract:</strong>The reverse reproduces verbatim the clauses of the concession contract with the State, including Clause 8.&ordf; on issuance authorizations and control of the bank's commercial books &mdash;, a practice of contractual transparency that was unusual in conventional banknotes of the time.</p>\n          </div>\n\n          <div style=\"margin-top:36px;\">\n            <h2 style=\"font-size:15px; letter-spacing:0.2em; text-transform:uppercase; color:#5c4e33; font-weight:600; margin:0 0 14px; font-style:normal;\">Key Details Visible on the Identification Card</h2>\n            <ul style=\"list-style:none; margin:0; padding:0; display:flex; flex-direction:column; gap:14px;\">\n              <li style=\"display:flex; gap:12px; align-items:baseline;\">\n                <span style=\"width:6px; height:6px; min-width:6px; background:#5c4e33; transform:rotate(45deg); position:relative; top:-3px;\"></span>\n                <span style=\"font-size:19px; line-height:1.6; color:#332e22;\"><strong style=\"color:#1c1a15;\">Upper vignette:</strong>Andean condor in red ink with wings fully spread, national heraldic symbol.</span>\n              </li>\n              <li style=\"display:flex; gap:12px; align-items:baseline;\">\n                <span style=\"width:6px; height:6px; min-width:6px; background:#5c4e33; transform:rotate(45deg); position:relative; top:-3px;\"></span>\n                <span style=\"font-size:19px; line-height:1.6; color:#332e22;\"><strong style=\"color:#1c1a15;\">Main text:</strong>&ldquo;THE BANK OF COLOMBIA will pay to the bearer ONE PESO IN LEGAL GOLD, (equivalent to four shillings (&pound; 0.4.0) English currency). This mortgage bond is issued on the date in accordance with Law 24 of 1905 and the contract entered into between the National Government and the Bank of Colombia on February 6, 1912.&rdquo;</span>\n              </li>\n              <li style=\"display:flex; gap:12px; align-items:baseline;\">\n                <span style=\"width:6px; height:6px; min-width:6px; background:#5c4e33; transform:rotate(45deg); position:relative; top:-3px;\"></span>\n                <span style=\"font-size:19px; line-height:1.6; color:#332e22;\"><strong style=\"color:#1c1a15;\">Signatures:</strong>Ernesto Michelsen, Eduardo Collins and Liborio Maldonado C., directors and administrators of the entity.</span>\n              </li>\n              <li style=\"display:flex; gap:12px; align-items:baseline;\">\n                <span style=\"width:6px; height:6px; min-width:6px; background:#5c4e33; transform:rotate(45deg); position:relative; top:-3px;\"></span>\n                <span style=\"font-size:19px; line-height:1.6; color:#332e22;\"><strong style=\"color:#1c1a15;\">Reverse:</strong>rectangular frame of geometric guilloché lace in blue; In the center, panels with the contractual clauses, highlighting the mention of Clause 8.&ordf; on authorizations for the issuance and control of commercial books.</span>\n              </li>\n              <li style=\"display:flex; gap:12px; align-items:baseline;\">\n                <span style=\"width:6px; height:6px; min-width:6px; background:#5c4e33; transform:rotate(45deg); position:relative; top:-3px;\"></span>\n                <span style=\"font-size:19px; line-height:1.6; color:#332e22;\"><strong style=\"color:#1c1a15;\">Two-color lithographic pattern:</strong>layering of black and red engraving over a fine network of slate-blue lines as a defense against unauthorized photomechanical reproduction.</span>\n              </li>\n              <li style=\"display:flex; gap:12px; align-items:baseline;\">\n                <span style=\"width:6px; height:6px; min-width:6px; background:#5c4e33; transform:rotate(45deg); position:relative; top:-3px;\"></span>\n                <span style=\"font-size:19px; line-height:1.6; color:#332e22;\"><strong style=\"color:#1c1a15;\">Numbering:</strong>serial number &ldquo;103.697&rdquo; stamped in carmine ink on both sides of the obverse using a separate impact press.</span>\n              </li>\n            </ul>\n          </div>\n\n        </div>\n      </div>\n    </div>\n  </main>\n\n  \n    <div\n      role=\"dialog\"\n      aria-modal=\"true\"\n      aria-label=\"Enlarged certificate\"\n     \n     data-zoom-dialog=\"note-1\" hidden class=\"catalog-zoom-dialog\">\n      <button\n        data-zoom-close\n        aria-label=\"Close\"\n        style=\"position:absolute; top:24px; right:28px; background:transparent; border:1px solid rgba(231,222,201,0.4); color:#d8d2cd; font-size:22px; line-height:1; width:44px; height:44px; border-radius:50%; cursor:pointer;\"\n      >&times;</button>\n\n      <div style=\"position:absolute; top:24px; left:28px; display:flex; align-items:center; gap:6px; background:rgba(10,10,9,0.5); border:1px solid rgba(231,222,201,0.25); border-radius:999px; padding:6px;\">\n        <button type=\"button\" data-zoom-out\n          disabled=\"true\"\n          aria-label=\"Zoom out\"\n          style=\"width:38px; height:38px; border-radius:50%; border:none; background:transparent; color:#d8d2cd; font-size:20px; cursor:pointer;\"\n        >&minus;</button>\n        <span data-zoom-percent style=\"min-width:56px; text-align:center; font-size:14px; color:#e7ddc4; letter-spacing:0.05em;\">100%</span>\n        <button\n          disabled=\"false\"\n          data-zoom-in aria-label=\"Zoom in\"\n          style=\"width:38px; height:38px; border-radius:50%; border:none; background:transparent; color:#d8d2cd; font-size:20px; cursor:pointer;\"\n        >&#43;</button>\n      </div>\n\n      <div\n        style=\"overflow:hidden; max-width:calc(100vw - 16px); max-height:calc(100vh - 16px); touch-action:none;\"\n      >\n        <picture>\n          <source srcset=\"/uploads/colombia-banco-de-colombia-1-peso-oro-1919.webp\" type=\"image/webp\" />\n          <img data-zoom-image\n            src=\"/uploads/colombia-banco-de-colombia-1-peso-oro-1919.jpg\"\n            alt=\"Cédula hipotecaria de El Banco de Colombia, enlarged view\"\n            draggable=\"false\"\n            style=\"display:block; max-width:calc(100vw - 16px); max-height:calc(100vh - 16px); width:auto; height:auto; transform:; cursor:zoom-in; user-select:none;\"\n          />\n        </picture>\n      </div>\n\n      <span style=\"position:absolute; bottom:16px; left:50%; transform:translateX(-50%); font-size:14px; letter-spacing:0.06em; color:#b7ab8a; font-style:italic; pointer-events:none;\">Drag to move &middot; Mouse wheel to zoom</span>\n    </div>\n  \n\n  \n\n</div>",
      "recordTitle": "El Banco de Colombia",
